                     ;; Slice 2 closed the half of this that was not measured:
                     ;; the row could not reach a DEFINITION IDENTITY. The
                     ;; bridge refused every non-[:cap/call id] member, so a
                     ;; row holding :abort got no CID at all, and stripping it
