                     ;; ADJUDICATED 2026-09-03. Two commits decided this on
                     ;; 2026-09-02 in opposite directions, and each was
                     ;; internally reasonable:
                     ;;
                     ;;   kotoba-kir 984a507 -- `:abort` bridges into the
