                   :decided-by "adr-2608301500-guest-syntax-restrictions-classified-by-shielding-mechanism"}
   :reason "Ambient throw/try/catch is untracked non-local control flow: it exits
            scopes the inferred effect row never mentions and skips unwind
            obligations (dataspace facet retraction has no checked unwind yet).
            The ban is on the ambient form. Since 2026-09-02 the typed abort
