    :model :single-affine-value-family
    :not :general-ownership-borrow-lifetime
    :reason "A vector handle that is dead after an update can be updated in place, and the two are indistinguishable to every observer -- so this widening does not change what a program MEANS, only which lowering a backend may choose. It is one value family, not the general system this entry declines."
    :measured-gap
