 {:kernel-memory-windows
  ;; `:surface` names every head, not one per width. It listed eight of
  ;; forty-five until 2026-09-03, which read as "the tiers are a detail of
  ;; these eight" -- and a reader asking whether a 64 KiB u16 load exists got
